.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
A lightweight and minimal condition variable designed for simple thread synchronization scenarios\&. Unlike the heavy and business‑oriented primitives in \&.NET, \fBLightConditionVariable\fP provides a straightforward FIFO wait‑list and wake‑up mechanism suitable for most everyday use cases\&. 

Threads can register themselves using Add(LightThread) and will be resumed explicitly through \fBSignal\fP or \fBBroadcast\fP\&. No complex monitor logic or advanced runtime scheduling is involved\&. 
.PP
